test_mcp_docker	Build and push	2026-10-22T21:02:43.2607921Z             "body": "This draft preserves original local stdio MCP and adds bounded batch/jobs, private profiles/artifacts, production packaging, lifecycle controls and fork-specific installation. Publishing remains disabled; release acceptance is blocked.\n\nCandidate cc9562b keeps the reviewed VP9 metadata and orders Chromium's existing Browser.setWindowBounds completion before Emulation.setDeviceMetricsOverride. No extra viewport protocol request, browser input replay, default channel/transport change, frame skip/seek/warmup, encoder change or raised action/RPC/test/job limit. The prior concurrent requests can overlap in a controlled real full-Chromium calibration; native macOS cause/fix is still pending.\n\nIt also retries only one exact real Page.captureScreenshot capture-unavailable ProtocolError, under the original progress deadline and identical arguments, with abort guard before retry. Persistent errors fail after two attempts; other errors, real closed targets and timeouts retain one attempt. Deterministic prepare accepts exact registry829, reviewed metadata3eb, prior local capture2e36 or final9f975 bytes; unknown/matrix-onlyB46 remains rejected. Prepared core SHA9f9750ae24604e2099e1c1f6564d5d6cb3d19d30dfbc8b5ec61ba18c0989e25a.\n\nValidation: two checked-in actual-engine Node tests pass on20/22/24 (three viewport-order cases plus18 screenshot conditions); real owned captures precede controlled errors, not native cause reproduction. Six original video/stock PNG/PCM cases pass locally on Chromium/Firefox. Fresh final production install/all runtime smokes pass on Node22 with source hashes unchanged. Genuine clean Git checkouts verify registry and3eb migration to9f975, idempotent inode/mtime, and unknown-source rejection without rewrite. Main2e36 migration passes. Typecheck/lint pass;297-file dry pack excludes tests/evidence. Native96 acceptance is pending.\n\nLatest completed native95 atfdd83e0: batch39837568942 reports1620 passes/8 failures; original39837569201 reports600/8; completed summaries2220/16. All17 logs succeed/nonempty on first read. All five installed-package steps and four component lanes pass, including12 actual concurrent schema races. Actual Codex1k passes all3 OSs, model0/owned0. Linux main207/211/211; Mac208/3, Windows198/5. Mac raw943/SDK973/sync994 fail; separate server996 times out and direct-pipe1k passes. Windows Firefox declarative20/23, HTTP418 timeout, raw fresh10 at8/23, locator13/19 and429 one-hit/0-completed fail. Four separate Firefox controls pass10 fresh/230 actions each; these do not waive main failures.\n\nOriginal main Linux200/0 Mac196/4 Windows197/3 includes eight additive stock references each. All12 stock PNG pass, stock PCM11/12 (Windows WebKit stays ready0 after preload/user activation); original WebKit PCM/VP9 remain failed. Mac has two capture errors, gray recording and Firefox trusted-click interruption after58 confirmed clicks. Three fresh recording controls2/1, Windows legacy3/0, Docker2/0.\n\nNew producer evidence:118 actual JPEG headers,102 at320x240 and16 at320x98 across two short main/fresh streams, adjacent to Chromium source/failure receipts. Native95 inputs lack project attributes; raw adjacency is retained, and prospective receipts add project. The encoder pads98-high input with gray to240, explaining gray y100/y239 in both browser and independent ffmpeg frame zero despite red source PNG. Actual window bounds/cause/fix remains unmeasured; no speculative encoder change follows.\n\nFull same-snapshot process rows retained, including one legacy-only candidate with a narrow captured same-PID root birth mismatch. No role/name/age/window filtering, signals from hints, unsafe replay, lease clearance or retroactive clearance of native94's scoped survivor, native89 exits, or historical136/142 gaps. G00–G18 scopes and full logs: docs/CODEX_EXECUTION_LEDGER.md and docs/evidence/native95-summary.json. G18 BLOCKED; no merge/publication.",
